 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No cup, no wine, no water, no body drawn. Footsteps for «عابري سبيل» (both tafsirs: passing through the mosque), geometric for «عفوا غفورا», two paths for «أن تضلوا السبيل». 43:9-12 carries Al-Muyassar's note (shared by As-Sa'di: «منسوخة بتحريم الخمر مطلقا») that this came before wine was forbidden outright. 43:20-22 (illness: the tafsirs word the condition differently) and 43:26-37 are not glossed."
